{"3970990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chain Shotgun", "steam_appid": 3970990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You think a double-barrelled shotgun is a cool?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Then how about a triple-barrelled shotgun? </strong> <br><strong>Quadruple? Or perhaps ten... <i>T H O U S A N D </i>?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/b63a83dfa422bcd514af072e1b5d5892.poster.avif?t=1760552108\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/b63a83dfa422bcd514af072e1b5d5892.webm?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/b63a83dfa422bcd514af072e1b5d5892.mp4?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Chain Shotgun</strong> is a fast paced movement shooter wherein your only weapon is the multi-barrelled <strong>CHAIN SHOTGUN</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way though hordes of enemies as you explore the ruins of the <strong>FACILITY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MODIFY THE CHAIN SHOTGUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no limit to the amount of barrels the <strong>CHAIN SHOTGUN</strong> can hold - And why should there be!? Explore the <strong>FACILITY </strong>and add them to you arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/ecde90063afe2982f7e6c1dece29e68a.poster.avif?t=1760552108\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/ecde90063afe2982f7e6c1dece29e68a.webm?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/ecde90063afe2982f7e6c1dece29e68a.mp4?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each barrel can be loaded with different ammunition. Discover unique combinations to make your experience with the shotgun more enjoyable! Gunning down enemies, fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRING THEM THE PAIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hordes of enemies, make full use of the dynamic environment, gravity and every barrel of the <strong>CHAIN SHOTGUN.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/fa6ec3f898cd7a09a4f8e484328ead76.poster.avif?t=1760552108\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/fa6ec3f898cd7a09a4f8e484328ead76.webm?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970990/extras/fa6ec3f898cd7a09a4f8e484328ead76.mp4?t=1760552108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER A STRANGE DECAYING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the FACILITY and decipher the cryptic messages that lies beyond the overgrown walls and Turkish baths. Discover secrets and uncover what the old world left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p